{
  "met": "This 0 allows no purple squares, so these squares must be clear.",
  "needsAll": "This 4 needs all 4 of its squares purple, so these squares must be purple.",
  "needsMore": "This 7 needs 3 more purple squares than this 4, and only 3 of its empty squares are outside the 4's block, so these squares must be purple.",
